    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access currently features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 explorable biomes, each with unique enemies, multiple minibosses, and a main boss </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters, with many unique abilities to choose between and upgrade </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen base buildings which unlock persistent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ artifacts of power which can be combined in infinite possibilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/1ffcd5429357383a9e158f1cb6203d67.avif?t=1744131393\" width=674 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/abfb3ab462b586b2e5ea02767f62ba26.poster.avif?t=1744131393\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/abfb3ab462b586b2e5ea02767f62ba26.webm?t=1744131393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/abfb3ab462b586b2e5ea02767f62ba26.mp4?t=1744131393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Knight</strong> is a straightforward melee character with many different weapons, each with unique attack styles. Armor is key as this character is slow but hard-hitting. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash attack hurls the Knight into or out of combat and can be upgraded to set enemies ablaze!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify armor makes the Knight an impenetrable tank and can additionally cleanse the hero from all negative status effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fearsome warchant terrifies surrounding enemies and sends them fleeing! Upgrade to embolden the Knight with a temporary increase in attack speed and damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/c8f075d9cde29712ac17af55042d0c74.poster.avif?t=1744131393\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/c8f075d9cde29712ac17af55042d0c74.webm?t=1744131393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/c8f075d9cde29712ac17af55042d0c74.mp4?t=1744131393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Ranger</strong> is a shadowy archer, reliant on stealth and distance from foes. Utilize a variety of bows and arrow types to exploit your enemy\u2019s weaknesses. Fast movement and careful planning will keep this hero alive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scatter a blanket of caltrops behind in the Ranger\u2019s footsteps to slow down and damage pursuing enemies. Upgrade quantity and quality to lacerate foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate fire rate and watch the enemy fall in droves! Upgrade to unleash a volley of arrows at inhuman speeds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the Ranger into an agent of shadow by throwing down obscuring smoke clouds. Further upgrade this ability to unleash a massive poisonous plume!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/d69741b8d0303129bb20583663daec8a.poster.avif?t=1744131393\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/d69741b8d0303129bb20583663daec8a.webm?t=1744131393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/d69741b8d0303129bb20583663daec8a.mp4?t=1744131393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Beastmaster</strong> brings his friends from the forest. Summon allies and avoid direct combat while tactically turning the tide of battle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With many summons active, the Beastmaster gives a rallying cry, gathering all friends in one place and bolstering them with immunities and enhancements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a quick escape by burrowing beneath the enemy\u2019s feet. Upgrade to further embolden the Beastmaster\u2019s allies, or to increase personal strength and strike from below!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy bear traps, stopping enemies in their paths and creating the perfect opportunity for your animal companions to strike! Upgrade and permanently cripple foe\u2019s movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further enhance your heroes by implementing small stat increases or temporarily boost with a variety of potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dungeons and mine mysterious geodes to uncover many artifacts of power. Each artifact contributes a unique effect and can be merged with others to create bizarre and powerful combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept quests from your townsfolk, then go out adventuring to garner greater fame and other rewards.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access currently features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 explorable biomes, each with unique enemies, multiple minibosses, and a main boss </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters, with many unique abilities to choose between and upgrade </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen base buildings which unlock persistent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ artifacts of power which can be combined in infinite possibilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/1ffcd5429357383a9e158f1cb6203d67.avif?t=1744131393\" width=674 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/abfb3ab462b586b2e5ea02767f62ba26.poster.avif?t=1744131393\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/abfb3ab462b586b2e5ea02767f62ba26.webm?t=1744131393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/abfb3ab462b586b2e5ea02767f62ba26.mp4?t=1744131393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Knight</strong> is a straightforward melee character with many different weapons, each with unique attack styles. Armor is key as this character is slow but hard-hitting. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash attack hurls the Knight into or out of combat and can be upgraded to set enemies ablaze!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify armor makes the Knight an impenetrable tank and can additionally cleanse the hero from all negative status effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fearsome warchant terrifies surrounding enemies and sends them fleeing! Upgrade to embolden the Knight with a temporary increase in attack speed and damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/c8f075d9cde29712ac17af55042d0c74.poster.avif?t=1744131393\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/c8f075d9cde29712ac17af55042d0c74.webm?t=1744131393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/c8f075d9cde29712ac17af55042d0c74.mp4?t=1744131393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Ranger</strong> is a shadowy archer, reliant on stealth and distance from foes. Utilize a variety of bows and arrow types to exploit your enemy\u2019s weaknesses. Fast movement and careful planning will keep this hero alive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scatter a blanket of caltrops behind in the Ranger\u2019s footsteps to slow down and damage pursuing enemies. Upgrade quantity and quality to lacerate foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate fire rate and watch the enemy fall in droves! Upgrade to unleash a volley of arrows at inhuman speeds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the Ranger into an agent of shadow by throwing down obscuring smoke clouds. Further upgrade this ability to unleash a massive poisonous plume!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/d69741b8d0303129bb20583663daec8a.poster.avif?t=1744131393\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/d69741b8d0303129bb20583663daec8a.webm?t=1744131393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872910/extras/d69741b8d0303129bb20583663daec8a.mp4?t=1744131393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Beastmaster</strong> brings his friends from the forest. Summon allies and avoid direct combat while tactically turning the tide of battle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With many summons active, the Beastmaster gives a rallying cry, gathering all friends in one place and bolstering them with immunities and enhancements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a quick escape by burrowing beneath the enemy\u2019s feet. Upgrade to further embolden the Beastmaster\u2019s allies, or to increase personal strength and strike from below!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy bear traps, stopping enemies in their paths and creating the perfect opportunity for your animal companions to strike! Upgrade and permanently cripple foe\u2019s movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further enhance your heroes by implementing small stat increases or temporarily boost with a variety of potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dungeons and mine mysterious geodes to uncover many artifacts of power. Each artifact contributes a unique effect and can be merged with others to create bizarre and powerful combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept quests from your townsfolk, then go out adventuring to garner greater fame and other rewards.</p>",
    "short_description": "Calling all Heroes! The age of knights is in its twilight, but the people still require your aid! Venture through various randomly-generated locales, complete quests and take down fearsome bosses. Return to your home estate to construct new buildings, equip powerful weapons, and rally new heroes!",
